        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[NalamDesk is a secure, offline-first clinic management system. Your patient]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>NalamDesk is a secure, offline-first clinic management system. Your patient
data lives on your own computer, encrypted, and the clinic runs its full
day with no internet.</p>
<!-- -->
<p>Start with the <a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/intro">User Guide</a>:</p>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong><a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/initial-setup">Initial Setup</a></strong>: create the
encrypted vault and the administrator account.</li>
<li class=""><strong><a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/admin-management">Admin Management</a></strong>: clinic
details, staff accounts, backups.</li>
<li class=""><strong><a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/clinic-operations">Clinic Operations</a></strong>:
registration, queue and triage, consultations, prescriptions.</li>
<li class=""><strong><a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/daily-collection">Daily Collection</a></strong>: receipts
and the ledger-derived day close.</li>
<li class=""><strong><a class="" href="https://sankara-sabapathy.github.io/nalamdesk/docs/user-guide/patient-merge">Merging Duplicate Charts</a></strong>:
preview-first merge with rollback.</li>
</ul>
<p>NalamDesk is free software under AGPL-3.0. The code lives on
<a href="https://github.com/sankara-sabapathy/nalamdesk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">GitHub</a> and installers
ship from <a href="https://github.com/sankara-sabapathy/nalamdesk/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">GitHub Releases</a>.</p>]]></content>
